+
+/**
+ * Whether native styled text keeps a link for this URL (native `link.isStorableUrl`): 1-2048 UTF-8 bytes, none
+ * below 0x20, 0x7f or 0x80-0x9f. Any scheme; only http, https and mailto are ever written as OSC 8 hyperlinks.
